+payments and service receipts are averaged over (facilityTick - 360,
+facilityTick], i.e. the last six operating/game hours. Before six hours, use
+receipts since opening. During the first hour, divide actual receipts by one
+hour and explicitly label the result an early estimate; no receipts means zero
+income. Tick-zero receipts count until the six-hour boundary. Fractional receipt
+times are supported. Pausing, speed selection, day rollover and reload do not
+change the window's meaning.
