+Average gross income minus average receipt stock costs minus current obligations
+is the hourly NET. Current obligations come from the existing negative
+getOperatingExpensePerFacilityHour selector. Management shows salaries, full room
+upkeep before relief, advertising, recent average stock, and a negative upkeep
